<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Your practical security learning hub</p>
      <h1>Make agentic cloud security <span>practical.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">Find clear paths through AI agent security, cloud defense, identity, and runtime protection—without the noise.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/tools">Explore security tools <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/labs">Start a hands-on lab</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note"><span class="status-dot"></span> Free, open resources for builders and defenders</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Secure agent execution flow">
      <div class="visual-label"><span>SECURE BY DESIGN</span><span class="visual-status"><i></i> Guarded</span></div>
      <div class="agent-card">
        <span class="agent-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
        <div><strong>AI agent</strong><small>Plans, reasons, requests actions</small></div>
        <span class="agent-indicator"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-line"><span></span></div>
      <div class="guardrail-grid">
        <div><span class="guardrail-icon">01</span><strong>Identity</strong><small>Least privilege</small></div>
        <div><span class="guardrail-icon">02</span><strong>Policy</strong><small>Human approval</small></div>
        <div><span class="guardrail-icon">03</span><strong>Runtime</strong><small>Audit signals</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-line"><span></span></div>
      <div class="target-row"><span>Cloud APIs</span><span>Data</span><span>Workloads</span></div>
      <div class="visual-foot"><span>Every action</span><span>·</span><span>Within bounds</span><span>·</span><span>Observable</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats-strip" aria-label="Community resources">
  <div class="container stats-grid">
    <div><strong>{@tool_count |> Integer.to_string() |> String.replace(~r/(?<=\d)(?=(\d{3})+$)/, ",")}+</strong><span>security tools to explore</span></div>
    <div><strong>{@lab_count}</strong><span>hands-on learning paths</span></div>
    <div><strong>{@post_count}</strong><span>field notes to start with</span></div>
    <p>Less searching.<br /><b>More learning.</b></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Explore with intent</p>
      <h2>A clear next step for the problem you’re solving.</h2>
      <p>Start with a practical goal, then follow focused resources built for real security work.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="resource-grid">
      <a class="resource-card" href="/labs">
        <span class="card-number">01 / PRACTICE</span><span class="resource-icon icon-green">↗</span>
        <h3>Learn by doing</h3><p>Build real intuition with guided labs for threat modeling, zero trust, and agentic security.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Browse hands-on labs <b>→</b></span>
      </a>
      <a class="resource-card" href="/tools">
        <span class="card-number">02 / DISCOVER</span><span class="resource-icon icon-blue">⌕</span>
        <h3>Find the right tools</h3><p>Explore open-source projects and platforms for identity, cloud defense, testing, and runtime.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Explore the tool stack <b>→</b></span>
      </a>
      <a class="resource-card" href="/blog">
        <span class="card-number">03 / UNDERSTAND</span><span class="resource-icon icon-amber">✳</span>
        <h3>Keep learning</h3><p>Read practical guides and field notes from the evolving security landscape.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Read the blog <b>→</b></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint">
  <div class="container focus-layout">
    <div class="section-heading focus-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">The security picture</p>
      <h2>Protect every layer of agentic execution.</h2>
      <p>Agents connect models to credentials, data, APIs, and infrastructure. We focus on the controls that keep that autonomy useful, observable, and bounded.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about">Why this work matters <b>→</b></a>
    </div>
    <div class="focus-list">
      <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Identity & access</h3><p>Least-privilege permissions, delegated authorization, and approval boundaries.</p></div></article>
      <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Tools & isolation</h3><p>Contain execution, data access, and cloud actions with secure defaults.</p></div></article>
      <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Runtime defense</h3><p>Observe prompts, tool calls, and changes so risk can be detected in context.</p></div></article>
      <article><span>04</span><div><h3>Governance & assurance</h3><p>Turn tests, audit trails, and human oversight into lasting evidence.</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container community-panel">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Built together</p><h2>Help make the cloud safer for everyone.</h2><p>Share a tool, improve a lab, publish a field note, or help turn new risks into practical guidance.</p></div>
    <a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/CloudSecCorner" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contribute on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
